abstract: >-
  Analysis code, saved intermediate and final tables, public-source provenance,
  and figure-rendering sources for a ten-locus comparison of Staphylococcus
  phage array-associated reverse transcriptase loci and a culture-paired
  reanalysis of twelve public SA1 RNA-seq libraries. This citation describes
  repository version 1.0.0.
